SOURCE {"locator":{"line":1},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
# Mock service with Cloudflare Workers

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":3},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
Your flow's tools call a mock service that you write, instead of the real bank service. You publish this service as a free Cloudflare Worker. The `example/` folder here only shows the pattern: a Worker with a single endpoint (`POST /ping`). You will write the statement-debt services yourself.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":5},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
