SOURCE {"locator":{"line":8},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
- A free Cloudflare account (dash.cloudflare.com)

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":9},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
- Wrangler (Cloudflare's command-line tool): runs without installing, via `npx wrangler ...`

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":11},"sha256":"6e50898b1bcc91ca76646b557786d722888bb8ae96aa719f20b659daa23abd6a","source":"cloudflare-mock/README.md"}
