## 6. Statement by e-mail

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":228},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
What it does: the PDF of the card's most recent statement goes to the e-mail address on file with us. No customer data changes. Once it's out we can't call it back, so we need a clear go-ahead.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":230},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
1. Registered address: already fetched for the offer (5.2). If there isn't one, the e-mail option is never offered. If the caller asks for it anyway: “Bankamızda kayıtlı bir e-posta adresiniz bulunmadığı için ekstrenizi gönderemiyorum.” Then offer the statement week change if they still have the right, otherwise main menu.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":231},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
2. Ask: “Ekstrenizi … adresine göndermemi ister misiniz?” A short, readable address is read as it is. A long or messy one is shortened, e.g. “m ile başlayan Gmail adresiniz”. Never spelled letter by letter.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":232},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
3. Only after a clear yes, call `statement.pdf.send`, and only ever with the registered address.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":233},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
4. Success: “Ekstreniz kayıtlı e-posta adresinize gönderildi.” then “Sizi ana menüye yönlendiriyorum.”

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":235},"sha256":"c33b5640a06f6be6e6d3cc7f86189ab75bf4ffb4e935874b3ee3b48b03ff1094","source":"sources/emails/attachments/2026-10-08-statement-debt-analysis.md"}
