## Things worth knowing about this data

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":30},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- Card numbers are masked: first 6 + last 4 in `cards.list` and `statement.week.get` (`540000******1234`), first 4 + last 4 in the `cards.balance` answer (`5400********1234`). Only the first six and last four digits exist in this data; nothing else is there to match against.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":31},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- Some customers have two cards with the same product name and the same last four digits, which differ only in the first six.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":32},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- Some cards share a statement with another card (`relationType` `M` / `C` in `statement.week.get`): customers 92220795, 95960044 and 97974112.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":33},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- A few cards have no `debtGBP` block in `cards.balance`.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":34},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- Product names come straight from the card system as free text; one is empty.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":35},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- Dates are fixed in the data (`dd.MM.yyyy`). Amounts are numbers with a dot as decimal separator.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":36},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
- A successful `statement.pdf.send` returns `data.exitState` `"DONE"`.

SOURCE {"locator":{"line":38},"sha256":"f0c6607e8ad2c874608dc39d8ab13fbb11f5f1f2975c08fe871a378c32815375","source":"test-environment/test-customers.md"}
